00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:04.240
We'll be right back.

00:25:30.570 --> 00:25:40.220
I knew that everybody was afraid, confused, and all that, but we all knew that it can't last that way forever.

00:25:41.390 --> 00:25:44.920
Everybody had to be nice to each other and try to help.

00:25:48.780 --> 00:25:51.880
It was a terrible day, but I think we can come back together.

00:25:55.040 --> 00:25:59.960
We all wish we lived in a perfect world, and if we could make it that way, we would.

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:02.210
But the world is not perfect.

00:26:02.970 --> 00:26:05.130
Sometimes bad things do happen.

00:26:05.250 --> 00:26:08.130
And occasionally, the world can be a scary place to be.

00:26:08.580 --> 00:26:11.310
But when we have each other,

00:26:11.980 --> 00:26:14.330
kindness, generosity of the human spirit,

00:26:14.490 --> 00:26:16.840
and love will always triumph.

00:26:17.820 --> 00:26:21.030
And then we can get through even the toughest of times.

00:26:22.330 --> 00:26:22.830
Right, guys?

00:26:23.260 --> 00:26:23.660
Right.

00:26:24.140 --> 00:26:26.800
We'll see you next time.

